# Market data caches and derived datasets are large and reproducible via
# src/fetch_candles.py + src/clean_data.py
data/raw/
data/candles/
# Raw Dukascopy monthly cache: large, and re-downloadable by
# src/fetch_decade_pool.py. The derived data/decade/*.parquet are tracked.
data/h1/
# Derived from data/gex/daily + metrics.jsonl by `gexdb.py rebuild`, and the
# raw payloads are ~500KB/day. The committed text files are the record.
data/gex/gex.db
data/gex/gex.db-*
data/gex/raw/
# Re-fetchable caches. data/pead/events.json and universe.json are the derived
# artifacts worth keeping; the per-company EDGAR JSON and price parquets are not.
data/edgar/
data/pead/px/
data/mbo/
data/*.parquet
data/*.csv

logs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
